      "filename": "Chicago from the Air (1974) (6011095887).jpg",
      "title": "File:Chicago from the Air (1974) (6011095887).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fd/Chicago_from_the_Air_%281974%29_%286011095887%29.jpg",
